alid","The href attribute requires a valid value to be accessible. Provide a valid, navigable address as the href value. If you cannot provide a valid href, but still need the element to resemble a link, use a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/HEAD/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","The href attribute is required for an anchor to be keyboard accessible. Provide a valid, navigable address as the href value. If you cannot provide an href, but still need the element to resemble a link, use a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/HEAD/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","jsx-a11y/img-redundant-alt","Redundant alt attribute. Screen-readers already announce `img` tags as an image. You don’t need to use the words `image`, `photo,` or `picture` (or any specified custom words) in the alt prop.","Imported JSX component Btn_Dashboard must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Btn_CertDb must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Btn_ClientDB must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Btn_Users must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component CertDB_Products must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","no-unused-vars","'Component' is defined but never used.","Identifier","unusedVar","'oktaAuth' is assigned a value but never used.","'FaUpload' is defined but never used.","'selectedFile' is assigned a value but never used.","'filePreview' is assigned a value but never used.","'handleFileChange' is assigned a value but never used."]